                                "example_id": "e26de65d-b648-4484-9b38-16b7be3f5ffb",
                                "sense_id": "3bc066e2-3a05-367a-a195-cfb46245f307",
                                "text": "They usually bear teeth on a dentigerous process or, occasionally, as in Hemiphractus, odontoids (projections of bone resembling teeth)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "399646c4-4d82-4f07-b31d-03efca0d4561",
                                "sense_id": "3bc066e2-3a05-367a-a195-cfb46245f307",
                                "text": "Occasionally dentigerous cysts may be lined partially or wholly by pseudostratified columnar epithelium with cilia and mucous cells."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "63f9a0c9-a91a-4815-b109-076120e85d79",
                                "sense_id": "3bc066e2-3a05-367a-a195-cfb46245f307",
                                "text": "Female with dentigerous plate of ovipositor moderately wide and bearing 8–12 teeth; anal appendages of female not particularly pointed (B)."
